  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory incorrectly quotes the map label for this site as \"Xylokastro 1\", but places it correctly \"on Kalamos Is.\" The \"Xylokastro\" on Kalamos is labeled \"Xylokastro 2\" (Map 54 C4).</p>",
